Hi Jaylen

Here is the requested business information for One Carolina Transit, LLC:

Business Information

  - Business Name: One Carolina Transit, LLC
  - Title: Owner, Chief Executive Officer
  - Phone Number: 803-549-8920 (for appointments)
  - Mailing Address: 1832 Red Hill Church Rd, Cassatt, SC 29032
  - Physical Address: 402-H Dicey Ford Rd, Camden, SC 29020
  - Hours of Operation: 6:00 AM =E2=80=93 6:00 PM

Services & Policies

  - Services Provided: Ambulatory and wheelchair transportation.
  - Insurance & Private Pay: Primarily serves private-pay clients (those
without insurance or who have exhausted their insurance benefits). Clients
with insurance should contact the dispatcher or their broker to arrange
coverage.
  - Booking Notice: Rides must be requested at least 72 hours in advance.
Full payment is required to complete the booking.
  - Cancellation Policy: Cancellations made at least 24 hours prior to the
appointment will receive a 25% reimbursement of the trip cost.
  - Rescheduling Policy: Trips must be rebooked at least 72 hours in
advance.

Rates & Payment

  - Pricing: $10.00 loading fee plus $1.25 per mile (round trip).
  - Payment Methods: Zelle, Cash App, and Square (pending setup).

Service Area

  - Current Coverage: South Carolina (specifically Kershaw, Richland,
Lexington, Sumter, Orangeburg, Bamberg, and Lancaster counties). We are
licensed to operate across three states as needed.

Credibility & Licensing

  - Driver Vetting: All drivers undergo national/federal criminal
background checks, sex offender registry checks, 10-panel drug screens, and
10-year driving record reviews. Drivers are CPR-certified and trained in
defensive driving and wheelchair assistance.
  - Licensing: Licensed with the Office of Regulatory Staff (ORS) and
Public Service Commission (PSC Certification #9156-A). Note: Not associated
with the VANS program.
  - Testimonials & Media: Customer reviews are available on Google under
"One Carolina Transit." Company colors are blue and white; photos of staff,
vehicles, and facilities are available upon request.

Ride Request Operations

  - Ride requests are monitored and managed by the Supervisor and Office
Manager.

Please let me know if you need any additional details.

